# Code of Conduct

## Our Pledge
We pledge to make participation in our community a welcoming and respectful experience for everyone.

## Our Standards
- Be respectful and considerate.
- Welcome different viewpoints and experiences.
- Accept constructive feedback gracefully.
- Avoid harassment, discrimination, and personal attacks.

## Enforcement Responsibilities
Community maintainers are responsible for clarifying and enforcing our standards.

## Scope
This Code of Conduct applies to all community spaces and public interactions related to this project.

## Enforcement
Inappropriate behavior may result in a warning, temporary suspension, or permanent removal from the community.

## Attribution
This Code of Conduct is adapted from common open-source community guidelines.
